/* 自定义导航栏 ·「政企蓝白」：浅底页 1rpx 发丝底线，品牌深蓝页首取消底线 */
.nav-wrap {
  width: 100%;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--app-border, #e5e6eb);
}

.nav-wrap.nav-dark {
  border-bottom-color: transparent;
}

.nav-row {
  position: relative;
  height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.nav-left {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.nav-title {
  position: absolute;
  left: 160rpx;
  right: 160rpx; /* 右侧避开微信胶囊按钮区域 */
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
}

.nav-title-text {
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.ico-44 {
  font-size: 44rpx;
}

@media (min-width: 600px) {
  .nav-row {
    height: 56px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .nav-left {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    flex: none;
  }

  .nav-title {
    position: static;
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .ico-44 {
    font-size: 22px;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .nav-row {
    height: 60px;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .nav-title {
    font-size: 18px;
  }
}
